      "messages": [
        {
          "content": "Challenger review, case-cb4848dd6210-0001. Checking the signed Riverside ledger for 14 October: receipts 6+5+6 = 17 units; dispatches 8+5+6+4 = 23 units. The ledger also states no other receipts or dispatches were recorded that day. The claim 'Riverside dispatched more units than it received on 14 October' is therefore supported on its own record: 23 > 17, a net outflow of 6 units. The internal totals are consistent with the itemised lines and the closed-ledger statement removes the main gap that could have undercut the comparison. On this evidence the claim is supported, so I am not filing a challenge. Nothing here is an assessment of whether the ledger itself is truthful, only that the claim accurately reports what the ledger records.",
          "content_hash": "0x954d79600e55d6910f3c6d529a6fb7c0499c92e96d6e27359354d22e2c24a110",
          "created_at_ms": 1793319264849,
